<title>UK: SOCCER SHOWCASE-ENGLISH F.A. CUP WINNERS SINCE 1946.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-ENGLISH F.A. CUP WINNERS SINCE 1946.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chelsea and Middlesbrough contest</p>
<p>the 52nd post-War English F.A. Cup Final at Wembley on Saturday.</p>
<p>The previous finals since the War have been:</p>
<p>1946-46  Derby County 4  Charlton 1</p>
<p>1946-47  Charlton 1 Burnley 0</p>
<p>1947-48  Manchester United 4 Blackpool 2</p>
<p>1948-49  Wolves 3 Leicester 1</p>
<p>1949-50  Arsenal 2 Liverpool 0</p>
<p>1950-51  Newcastle 2 Blackpool 0</p>
<p>1951-52  Newcastle 1 Arsenal 0</p>
<p>1952-53  Blackpool 4 Bolton 3</p>
<p>1953-54  West Brom 3 Preston North End 2</p>
<p>1954-55  Newcastle 3 Manchester City 1</p>
<p>1955-56  Manchester City 3 Birmingham 1</p>
<p>1956-57  Aston Villa 2 Manchester United 1</p>
<p>1957-58  Bolton 2 Manchester United 0 </p>
<p>1958-59  Nottingham Forest 2 Luton Town 1</p>
<p>1959-60  Wolves 3 Blackburn Rovers 0</p>
<p>1960-61  Tottenham Hotspur 2 Leicester 0</p>
<p>1961-62  Tottenham Hotspur 3 Burnley 1</p>
<p>1962-63  Manchester United 3 Leicester 1</p>
<p>1963-64  West Ham 3 Preston North End 2</p>
<p>1964-65  Liverpool 2 Leeds 1</p>
<p>1965-66  Everton 3 Sheffield Wednesday 2</p>
<p>1966-67  Tottenham Hotspur 2 Chelsea 1</p>
<p>1967-68  West Brom 1 Everton 0</p>
<p>1968-69  Manchester City 1 Leicester City 0</p>
<p>1969-70r Chelsea 2 Leeds 1</p>
<p>1970-71  Arsenal 2 Liverpool 1</p>
<p>1971-72  Leeds 1 Arsenal 0</p>
<p>1972-73  Sunderland 1 Leeds 0</p>
<p>1973-74  Liverpool 3 Newcastle United 0</p>
<p>1974-75  West Ham 2 Fulham 0</p>
<p>1975-76  Southampton 1 Manchester United 0</p>
<p>1976-77  Manchester United 2 Liverpool 1</p>
<p>1977-78  Ipswich Town 1 Arsenal 0</p>
<p>1978-79  Arsenal 3 Manchester United 2</p>
<p>1979-80  West Ham 1 Arsenal 0</p>
<p>1980-81r Tottenham Hotspur 3 Manchester City 2</p>
<p>1981-82r Tottenham Hotspur 1 QPR 0</p>
<p>1982-83r Manchester United 4 Brighton 0</p>
<p>1983-84  Everton 2 Watford 0</p>
<p>1984-85  Manchester United 1 Everton 0</p>
<p>1985-86  Liverpool 3 Everton 1</p>
<p>1986-87  Coventry 3 Tottenham Hotspur 2</p>
<p>1987-88  Wimbledon 1 Liverpool 0</p>
<p>1988-89  Liverpool 3 Everton 2</p>
<p>1989-90r Manchester United 1 Crystal P 0</p>
<p>1990-91  Tottenham Hotspur 2 Nottingham Forest 1</p>
<p>1991-92  Liverpool 2 Sunderland 0</p>
<p>1992-93r Arsenal 2 Sheffield Wednesday 1</p>
<p>1993-94  Manchester United 4 Chelsea 0</p>
<p>1994-95  Everton 1 Manchester United 0</p>
<p>1995-96  Manchester United 1 Liverpool 0</p>
<p>r = replay result</p>
<p>Total wins (since 1871-72):</p>
<p>9 -- Manchester United</p>
<p>8 -- Tottenham Hotspur</p>
